expression: text
---
List the names of AWS Secrets Manager secrets under a prefix (never values)

Usage: kagebunshin aws list [OPTIONS] --prefix <PREFIX>

Options:
      --json               Print machine-readable JSON; errors go to stderr as JSON
      --prefix <PREFIX>    List secrets whose name starts with this, e.g. widget/dev/
      --profile <PROFILE>  The AWS profile [default: the ambient AWS configuration]
      --socket <PATH>      Daemon socket [default: $KAGEBUNSHIN_SOCKET, else a per-user runtime dir]
      --env <ENV>          Environment to use instead of the project's default
      --region <REGION>    The AWS region [default: the profile's, or AWS_REGION]
      --project <NAME>     Project to use instead of the one for this folder; it must claim this checkout's remotes
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
